                rites)
 0BF3   09B2    IF qkon <> 0 THEN GOSUB joeface: GOTO qstart
 0C14   09B2    
 0C14   09B2    '----- title screen
 0C14   09B2    SCREEN 1
 0C14   09B2    PALETTE 3, 0
 0C14   09B2    LOCATE 10, 12
